{"id":72998,"date":"2026-11-07T06:56:13","date_gmt":"2026-11-07T06:56:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72998"},"modified":"2026-11-07T07:57:59","modified_gmt":"2026-11-07T06:57:59","slug":"hx365-simulacao-hyrox","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/hx365-simulacao-hyrox\/","title":{"rendered":"Hx365 Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Hx365 Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Hx365 Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>16 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, entre as <strong>10h00 e as 17h00<\/strong>, nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da <strong>HX365<\/strong> (Rua da Economia 297, Pavilh\u00e3o F), na freguesia de <strong>Vilarinho das Cambas<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>). Organizado pela <strong>HX365<\/strong> em parceria com o <strong>Grupo Recreativo de Covense<\/strong>, o evento reproduz na \u00edntegra a experi\u00eancia de competi\u00e7\u00e3o de fitness racing com equipamento oficial CENTR e cronometragem por chip.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A prova segue a estrutura cl\u00e1ssica de <strong>8 corridas de 1 km<\/strong> intercaladas com <strong>8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es de esfor\u00e7o funcional<\/strong>: 1) SkiErg (1.000 m), 2) Sled Push (50 m), 3) Sled Pull (50 m), 4) Burpee Broad Jumps (80 m), 5) Remo (1.000 m), 6) Farmers Carry (200 m), 7) Sandbag Lunges (100 m) e 8) Wall Balls (100 repeti\u00e7\u00f5es). A competi\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 aberta a maiores de 16 anos e divide-se em 9 categorias \u2014 <strong>Singles (Individual) Open e Pro<\/strong> (Masculino e Feminino, 21 vagas por categoria) e <strong>Duplas Open, Pro e Mista<\/strong> (30 duplas por categoria), com 78 heats a partir de 5 em 5 minutos entre as 10h00 e as 16h25.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 <strong>31 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (ou at\u00e9 esgotarem as vagas), com o valor de <strong>20,00 \u20ac por atleta nos Singles<\/strong> e <strong>40,00 \u20ac por equipa nas Duplas<\/strong>, incluindo cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com chip, seguro de acidentes pessoais, ju\u00edzes de esta\u00e7\u00e3o, brinde de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e pr\u00e9mios para os vencedores de cada categoria. Descobre tamb\u00e9m <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/o-que-e-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">o que \u00e9 o HYROX<\/a> e consulta o calend\u00e1rio completo de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Provas HYROX<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-grad