ght: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Duplas Open, Pro e Mista - 8 x 1 km + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Dupla (at\u00e9 31 de dezembro de 2026):<\/strong> 40,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Hx365 Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 16 de janeiro de 2027, das 10h00 \u00e0s 17h00, no Pavilh\u00e3o F da Rua da Economia 297, em Vilarinho das Cambas, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o (distrito de Braga).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o formato e a ordem das 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os atletas completam 8 corridas de 1 km, cada uma seguida de uma esta\u00e7\u00e3o funcional pela ordem: 1) SkiErg (1.000 m), 2) Sled Push (50 m), 3) Sled Pull (50 m), 4) Burpee Broad Jumps (80 m), 5) Remo (1.000 m), 6) Farmers Carry (200 m), 7) Sandbag Lunges (100 m) e 8) Wall Balls (100 repeti\u00e7\u00f5es).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as categorias dispon\u00edveis e como funcionam os heats?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Existem 9 categorias (idade m\u00ednima de 16 anos): Singles Open M\/F, Singles Pro M\/F (21 vagas cada), Duplas Open M\/F, Duplas Pro M\/F e Duplas Mista (30 duplas cada). Os 78 heats saem de 5 em 5 minutos entre as 10h00 e as 16h25, devendo o check-in ser efetuado at\u00e9 30 minutos antes da hora de sa\u00edda.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o e o prazo de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 31 de dezembro de 2026 (ou limite de vagas) e t\u00eam o valor de 20,00 \u20ac por atleta nas categorias Singles e 40,00 \u20ac por equipa nas categorias de Duplas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e a tabela de cargas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial completo em PDF, com a tabela detalhada de pesos dos sleds, kettlebells, sandbags e alturas dos Wall Balls para Open, Pro e Mista, est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel no bot\u00e3o de regulamento desta p\u00e1gina.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Hx365 Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-16\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-16\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Vilarinho das Cambas, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o, Braga\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Hx365 Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox 2027 realiza-se a 16 de janeiro em Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o, com 8 km de corrida e 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es (Singles e Duplas). Inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-hx365-simulacao-hyrox.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Singles Open e Pro (Masculino e Feminino) - 8 x 1 km + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es\", \"price\": \"20.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/hx365_2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Duplas Open, Pro e Mista - 8 x 1 km + 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es\", \"price\": \"40.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/hx365_2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"HX365 \/ Grupo Recreativo de Covense\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Hx365 Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 16 de janeiro de 2027, das 10h00 \u00e0s 17h00, no Pavilh\u00e3o F da Rua da Economia 297, em Vilarinho das Cambas, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o (distrito de Braga).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o formato e a ordem das 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os atletas completam 8 corridas de 1 km, cada uma seguida de uma esta\u00e7\u00e3o funcional pela ordem: 1) SkiErg (1.000 m), 2) Sled Push (50 m), 3) Sled Pull (50 m), 4) Burpee Broad Jumps (80 m), 5) Remo (1.000 m), 6) Farmers Carry (200 m), 7) Sandbag Lunges (100 m) e 8) Wall Balls (100 repeti\u00e7\u00f5es).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as categorias dispon\u00edveis e como funcionam os heats?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Existem 9 categorias (idade m\u00ednima de 16 anos): Singles Open M\/F, Singles Pro M\/F (21 vagas cada), Duplas Open M\/F, Duplas Pro M\/F e Duplas Mista (30 duplas cada). Os 78 heats saem de 5 em 5 minutos entre as 10h00 e as 16h25, devendo o check-in ser efetuado at\u00e9 30 minutos antes da hora de sa\u00edda.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o e o prazo de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 31 de dezembro de 2026 (ou limite de vagas) e t\u00eam o valor de 20,00 \u20ac por atleta nas categorias Singles e 40,00 \u20ac por equipa nas categorias de Duplas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e a tabela de cargas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento oficial completo em PDF, com a tabela detalhada de pesos dos sleds, kettlebells, sandbags e alturas dos Wall Balls para Open, Pro e Mista, est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel no bot\u00e3o de regulamento desta p\u00e1gina.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":73001,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[1455],"event_type_2":[52,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-72998","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-famalicao-porto","event_type-hyrox","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-hx365-simulacao-hyrox-819x1024.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72998","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/w